// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Attack Surface Reduction (ASR) events summary
//
// Counts ASR events of the last 30 days per ActionType (AsrLsassCredentialTheftBlocked,
// AsrOfficeChildProcessAudited, ...). Gives a quick view of which ASR rules fire
// (audit or block) before switching rules from audit to block mode.
//
// Author      : Wassim Bizid
// Repository  : https://github.com/bizidwassim-design/public-scripts
// Requires    : Microsoft Defender XDR advanced hunting (DeviceEvents)
// Impact      : Read-only
// License     : MIT
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
DeviceEvents
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| where ActionType startswith "Asr"
| summarize EventCount=count() by ActionType
